DWS_LPMWC_Grant_Strategy, which the user_profile and order strategies implement, grants and revokes payment methods for a user on the current site or an unpaid order, and locked_payment_methods_for_woocommerce/grants/updated fires after every change the plugin makes to a user's, an order's, a Groups group's or a plan's unlocked payment methods.
